{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜🔔*゜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobSZcOK2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！日向坂46  金村美玖です🐞"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日9/30は18thシングル"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「イチャイチャ虫」の発売日です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早速CDをゲットしてくださった方"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ストリーミングで曲を聴いてくださった方"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回もMVは3つ公開されています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "○イチャイチャ虫🫶"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【https://youtu.be/mgFUz_c4ToM?si=I9ImEiXifW6dSa1B】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "○風にキンモクセイ🌬"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【https://youtu.be/QzNd53mcPLU?si=eBxVnPtldDzYWNeY】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "○それでもいつか🎻"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【https://youtu.be/uVgPrRdq4QU?si=wEecBYwQShX2kYt8】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それぞれ全く違うテイストで、日向坂46の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽曲の幅広さ、表現の違いを感じていただけると思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほかにもカップリング曲には"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ピンクのコスモス」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「イントロ」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「クリスマスカウントダウン」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「僕はAnytime」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "が収録されております"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入りの楽曲があったら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非教えてくださいね。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobZyGH62.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現在SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんでは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発売記念パネル展が開催中です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバー直筆パネルが見られますので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ期間中にご覧ください〜😚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私のパネルには写真集の予約QRまで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございますっ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10/5まで開催中です💨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここからは載せていなかった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イチャイチャ虫みくふぉとコーナー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわちいので見ていってね〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobbMqRmT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回はいろんな姿のよーこが見られたね！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他の場面は参加できなかったけど、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ボクシングジムもラーメン屋さんもかっこ可愛かった〜！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobC9g92p.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この小さいハートも美術さんの手作り！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "レザーのハート、展示されているのでみてね。なおちゃんかわいい。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobJyXdEj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "手乗りまなみん。あざとかわいい🥹"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobDyCFbL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごいニコニコなみっちゃん。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "曲中1か所だけ目が合うので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その時が楽しみです。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobq2BYlJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆうさくペア"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝手に名付けました！虫ポーズかわいい！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mob3kLviL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こにしオネイチャン"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんなファッションも似合うよね〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobTfXBGq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日の1枚目の写真を撮ってくれた子！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さきてぃのみくさん呼び嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとう☺️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobjJpOJR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いかがでしたか？みんな可愛かったですね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、発売日ということは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミーグリ等の応募も始まっています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🩵リアルミーグリ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年11月3日（火・祝）@幕張メッセ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年12月19日（土）@京都パルスプラザ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "💛オンラインミーグリ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年11月8日（日）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日程はこんな感じで、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1次応募期間は10/4いっぱいまでです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お好きなもの応募してみてね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "応募はコチラから！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【https://ticket.fortunemeets.app/hinatazaka46/18th#/】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非お待ちしています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はたくさん写真を載せたので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このあたりで。またね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "■2nd写真集ご予約はこちら📘"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://lit.link/miku_2ndbook"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "■金村美玖公式Instagram📸"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.instagram.com/miku_osushi/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "see you later✩.*˚#627"}], "source": "official"}